{"parse": {"title": "DIA-46", "pageid": 114381, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DIA-45\" title=\"DIA-45\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DIA-46</span><a href=\"/wiki/DIA-47\" title=\"DIA-47\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DIA</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">46</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.99.AE.E7.BD.97.E7.B1.B3.E4.BF.AE.E6.96.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"普罗米修斯\">普罗米修斯</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 普罗米修斯</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Prometheus Bound</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>没<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>高<span class=\"color-value\"></span>加<span class=\"color-value\"></span>索<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>崖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>但<span class=\"color-value\"></span>果<span class=\"color-value\"></span>篮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>样<span class=\"color-value\"></span>轻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>紧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510214</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_10\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-635511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——23枚德拉克马！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惊讶的呼喊远远传了出去，惊飞几只屋顶上的海鸥。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_10\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾经的“海盗”恶狠狠皱了皱眉头，压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>朋友，我可不是什么愣头青。我们只是打算拜托你打听一颗苹果的消息——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我了解这儿的物价，整整一升酿好的果酒也不过需要1/6枚德拉克马！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对面的吟游诗人站起身来，轻轻拨弄了一下纤细的琴弦，笑吟吟地看着她们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>当然，朋友。可你要找的是一颗鲜艳的、智慧的苹果～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>如果不出意外的话，我很可能还得跑一趟酒神的庆典。毕竟，如此特别的苹果只会存在于众神的怀抱中～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>努力思考其中深意的海盗不明所以，古希腊的神话故事显然令她水土不服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>咳——总之，不论你打算说些什么风趣的俚语或者漂亮话，都不能改变这一夸张要价的事实！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>再说了，我们也要考虑接受外邦人委托的风险呐。万一，你们中途溜走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>绝不可能，你可以到任何一片公海去打听打听星锑船长的名声——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双方正僵持不下时，一阵熟悉的脚步声传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>艾琳娜，上次你帮我盯梢的那个鬼祟家伙，我需要人手来……嗯？你在忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正在争论的双方回过头来，便看见一个飒爽的佣兵立于眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>嚯，看起来，你这还有别的主顾。我想我不该在这时打扰你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>啊不……欢迎！我亲爱的驯鹰人，没人能预测你这阵西风会在何时出现～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>我刚刚听到了，你说你需要人手……对了！对了对了，这就是了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吟游诗人的双眼放光，不住地喃喃自语，仿佛找到了妙招来摆脱眼前的这波麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清了清嗓子，笑容满溢的吟游诗人一手拉住星锑，一手拉住卡珊德拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>诸位，我一直相信众神自有安排。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>这位小姑娘，你来找我，是需要打听大酒神节庆典中一颗苹果的消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>而你，卡珊德拉，你上次托我盯梢的古怪家伙，经过我的调查，他对外的身份应该是一位修理大酒神节廊庙的工匠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>现在正是你需要人手协助搜集秩序神教线索的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等等，你该不会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">吟游诗人：</div><div>没错！我相信你们能遵循友爱、互惠的法则，圆满地实现对方的愿望！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>混蛋*，这家伙……我就知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佣兵无奈地摇摇头，充分了解吟游诗人无赖品性的她，在时间不足以充裕到另寻他人的情况下，决定暂且接受现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>既然都需要在大酒神节找什么东西，我们的目标应该不会偏差太多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>我会在寻找我的目标时，顺便帮你们一起找了。我想这难度应该不会很大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢……噢！既然你这么说了……咳咳，维尔汀，你怎么看？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海盗朝对面眨了眨眼，她显然不介意再多一个免费的帮手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您就是“驯鹰人”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>一路上，我们听闻了许多吟游诗人关于你的赞歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们说，传说中的驯鹰人是一位热情勇敢的英雄、乐于帮助所有人的守护者、你永远能够信赖的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>断矛的佣兵叉着腰，轻咳了两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>打住，两位，你们不是当地的居民吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>没什么，只是这儿的朋友都清楚，报出再多的名头也不能减免我的酬金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您误会了，我只是希望验证传说的真实性。请理解，合作应该建立在互相了解的基础上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佣兵挑了挑眉，没想到对方的恭维导向了对合作伙伴素质的质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>看来，我们不得不一起工作了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>斯巴达的卡珊德拉，如果不出意外的话，你们很快就能见识“驯鹰人”的本事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡珊德拉向两人伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>星锑。维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海盗小姐大咧咧地回握对方的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对了，我们要怎么互相帮助？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>很简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>在雅典城里闲逛，做任何你们想做的事，以及多留意着一切你们觉得可疑的人员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧张的海盗如临大敌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>因为大酒神节的缘故，雅典混进了太多来头不明的人员，光靠我一个人可没法排查干净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>来历不明……你就不怀疑我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佣兵又一次上下打量了眼前奇装异服的两人几眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>尽管我看不出你们的服饰风格来自于哪儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>但我可以确定的是，你们一定与斯巴达、科林斯或是佛基斯的佣兵没有任何关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>打算刺杀伯里克利的人可不会这么招摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵诡异的沉默后，海盗的惊讶声响彻云霄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么——！刺、刺杀伯里克利？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你委托我们对付的，是传说中穷凶极恶……杀人不眨眼的凶徒吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>传说有夸大事实的成分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>而且，知道太多对你们没有好处，按我说的去做会让事情更简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船长礼貌地点了点头，朝着另一个方向小声嘀咕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>维尔汀，我认为我们需要好好讨论下合作的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>尽快开始行动吧，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑的插科打诨被无情地搁置一旁，不远处的隐约歌声吸引了所有人的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯，那边是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_16_zone\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_16_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"221\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"956\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热闹的人潮缓缓涌来，染过了他们身前的每一寸土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喝醉的路人：</div><div>欢迎加入雅典的生活——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-517820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喝醉的路人：</div><div>来喝一杯吧，外乡的朋友们～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他们这是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>大酒神节的庆典开始了，现在正是你们混入的好时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>……当然，适当玩一玩也不坏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>了解了，我会注意周遭可疑的人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_10\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但英勇的船长似乎只听到了卡珊德拉后半句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>适当玩一玩是吗……可……APPLe先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船长低伏着头颅，像是正经历着一场痛苦的挣扎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-635513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-635513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-635513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>为了拯救你，我一定会在大酒神节里好好调查的——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音随着脚步声迅速远去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>维尔汀，你要为我作证～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>大酒神节——我来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>跟紧她，维尔汀，顺便注意周围的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>我去别的地方瞧瞧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>维尔汀，你看这个陶器，它很适合摆在我们的大厅里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>喔，瞧瞧船长的新亚麻长袍——好吧，它更适合夏天的公海旅行。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_10\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-s01_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>咳，星锑，我们是不是遗漏了些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无疑问，船长遭遇的诱惑不止一处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒神节商人：</div><div>姑娘们，你们不打算绘制一幅独属于自己的大酒神节面具吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着亲切的呼唤声望去，木头、皮革、柳枝、藤条、颜色各异的矿物与昆虫染料满满当当地躺在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>抱歉，我们还有要事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>当然！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兴冲冲的海盗显然不愿错过如此乐事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>给他们个机会吧，维尔汀。我还在主持APPLe电台的时候，多的是像这样的热情听众～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对他们来说，能得到一份类似我亲笔签名的小玩意，是一件值得刻在墓碑上的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-637001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒神节商人：</div><div>哈哈，到这儿来，好姑娘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等着吧，朋友，船长这就为你制作全宇宙独一无二的限量版星锑面具！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船长满意地欣赏着手中的杰作，浑然未觉佣兵的回归。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>迪普隆门与厄瑞克忒翁神庙大道区域都没有发现什么异常，你们这儿……呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两副风格鲜明的面具及时地堵住了卡珊德拉的询问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传奇驯鹰人的足迹几乎遍布整个地中海，也见识过许多异想天开的悲剧诗人与雕刻者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>看上去像我不理解的风格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手不动声色将面具收了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>对这个时代而言，它们确实稍微超前了一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佣兵还想说些什么，愈发欢腾的欢呼声盖过了所有人的耳膜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_16_zone\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_16_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"221\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_16_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"956\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欢呼声从不远处传了过来，歌声与酒浆一同被洒向天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盛满祭品的果篮顶在身着奇装艳服的少女们的头顶，熊熊燃烧的火把在仪仗队的手中飞舞着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>别紧张，维尔汀。只是大酒神节的游行开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>游行的队伍会在集市区会合，这是大酒神节最为隆重的时刻……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>庆祝的人们会把这儿挤得水泄不通。如果我打算干一票坏事，一定会选择在这个时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佣兵灵巧地避开越发拥挤的人群，朝着身后的两人挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后的两人听到一声嘹亮的鹰鸣，再望过去，佣兵的身影早已消失在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>地上的归你们，天上的交给我。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-s01_cg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-s01_cg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-s01_cg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-312401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>真热闹，不过看起来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-312413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-312413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-312413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>星锑，维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑&amp;维尔汀：</div><div>？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>你们正在寻找的APPLe先生，就是那颗苹果吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-635510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>我想我已经找到它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-312411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡珊德拉：</div><div>看起来，它正肩负着狄俄尼索斯赋予的重要使命。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DIA-46"}}